  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The Thalmor Justiciar slashes his blade at Natsuki.
  - The Thalmor Justiciar bonks Natsuki on the head, briefly numbing her, and slashes
    at her again.
  - The archer Justiciar fires homing arrows at the numbed Natsuki.
  - Two other Justiciar's coordinate their efforts against Natsuki, firing bolts
    of lightning and splitting arrows at her.
  - The archer Justiciar fires splitting arrows at Natsuki.
  - The archer Justiciar coordinates with the Justiciar Natsuki's currently fighting,
    firing splitting arrows while the other slashes at Natsuki.
  - The archer Justiciar fires homing arrows at Natsuki.
