  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The archer Justiciar fires homing arrows at Natsuki. Again.
  - The Thalmor Justiciar bonks Natsuki on the head to numb her before slashing at
    her. Again.
  - The Thalmor Justiciar slashes his blade at Natsuki. Again.
  maxHealth: 150
