  defeatText: Natsuki defeats the Justiciar she was occupied with and looks around
    to find that most of the Thalmor now lie dead.
  nameText: Thalmor Justiciar
  blurbText: Elf Nazi?!? Who could have foreseen this?!? (Play Skyrim yourself, and
